{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4e83eb5a-1b48-51ed-8290-5624f493196c", "source_ordinal": 1856, "reading_ordinal": 2200, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "贱猫手", "published_at": "2024-01-03T09:51:04+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/363717987/answer/3347849365"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "猫有一个刻画在本能里的基本认知——超过甲壳虫大小的可以轻易拨动的独立物体很可能可以食用。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 44}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你仔细去考虑，会发现如果是在自然环境中，这个大小的物体很少有可以轻易拨动的。", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如果是植物，往往有根系，扒拉不动。如果是石子、蜗牛壳这类长期静止在地面上的物体，很快会因为下了几场雨而半陷在泥土里，拨动有明显的生根感。如果是可以拨动的，石子、土块的手感也会有所不同。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 176}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你要知道猫是没有动物学概念的，对猫来说，能吃的东西只包含几个条件——闻起来有脂肪香味、会自主运动、咬上去口感正确可以撕裂而且味道可接受。", "char_start": 177, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "而这其中“可以自主运动”这一条还很重要，因为这往往是鉴定食材的第一步——否则岂不是每颗石头、每个土块、每朵蘑菇都要咬两口？", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 307}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "所以猫经常拿爪子拨动一下看看这是不是一个正在装死的甲虫或者其它小动物。如果动物受惊后开始逃窜，就说明是一个健康的活物。尤其是没有用喷射毒液这类方式自卫、颜色也不鲜艳的话，那都是可以吃的小零食。", "char_start": 308, "char_end": 404}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "问题是，摆在光滑桌面上的唇膏、发卡、钢笔、瓶盖子这类小物件在猫的手感上看明显不像是生了根的蘑菇或者推动阻力很大的石子、蜗牛壳，反倒是那种坚持装死的甲虫。尤其是钢笔和唇膏这种圆柱体，推倒后还有运动反馈。猫会忍不住要反复试探。", "char_start": 405, "char_end": 516}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "反复试探的结果就是这些东西很容易被推落桌面掉地上。", "char_start": 517, "char_end": 542}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "铺一个不那么滑的桌面皮垫、选那种八棱形的防滚设计的唇膏、香水瓶，很容易解决问题。", "char_start": 543, "char_end": 583}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0327"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么猫都喜欢把东西从桌子上推下去？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“贱猫手”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“猫有一个刻画在本能里的基本认知——超过甲壳虫大小的可以轻易拨动的独立物体很可能可以食用。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "猫有一个刻画在本能里的基本认知——超过甲壳虫大小的可以轻易拨动的独立物体很可能可以食用。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 44, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "85b9259f-4006-5722-b7e0-e3f8bb0e57bd", "source_ordinal": 1855, "reading_ordinal": 2201, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "IT装备解决方案", "published_at": "2024-01-03T12:39:55+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/545253024/answer/3348082671"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "因为很多企业都采用了错误的员工装备解决方案。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "对大部分企业而言，员工装备的最好方案都是租用——直接找租赁商租用指定型号的机器。", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 63}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这机器里要求预装的环境在合同中约好，坏了、中毒了立刻调备机，合同约定保障可用率。出了新机器、新需求，打个电话就能从ta们的设备库里调新机。", "char_start": 64, "char_end": 133}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这类租赁商神通广大的很，往往同时经营大规模的二手交易，常年收机、修机、卖机而且经营零配件。手里有大量的经典机型，而且都在可以销售的状态。收回来该换的一股脑一换，找个自己的标配壳子一装，崭崭新。你用着什么部件坏了，ta那边这种易损件有一柜子。你不用了ta也可以立刻转给其他客户或者挂起来卖掉。", "char_start": 134, "char_end": 279}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这种合同同样可以走采购合同和账期，只是把折旧成本转变成了租金成本。合同灵活，对于财务操作十分友好，操作得好，光是免掉的税都可以实现低成本用机，而且极为有利于实现轻资产。", "char_start": 280, "char_end": 364}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你还可以一口气签两家，以免要用的机器没有或者被特定商家卡脖子。", "char_start": 365, "char_end": 396}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0327"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么很多公司配的笔记本都特别渣？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006"], "summary": "围绕“IT装备解决方案”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“因为很多企业都采用了错误的员工装备解决方案。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "因为很多企业都采用了错误的员工装备解决方案。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "decd7397-1bb1-5754-b234-161459260edf", "source_ordinal": 1854, "reading_ordinal": 2202, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "以太主义", "published_at": "2024-01-04T00:58:40+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/585517335/answer/3348911002"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "说这话的人在想象自己是伟大导师，送别人“奴性”帽子只是ta享受这个待遇的必要手续。人家得个丑帽子，ta自己得个大奖章，既打击了敌人，又肥沃了自我，一箭双雕，性价比破表。除了容易挨打，简直没有缺点。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不过这不是问题的核心，问题的核心是这反映了说话人的洞察力缺陷——因为用“天生奴性”来解释ta自己理解不了的合作行为，水平比用“得罪龙王爷”解释干旱、用大鲶鱼解释地震还要低。", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 185}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "后者好歹还是有一定现实对称物的，比如得罪了张三被张三报复，猫妈妈翻身把背上的小猫滚了一跤之类。", "char_start": 186, "char_end": 233}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "而“天生奴性”纯属无对应的传说，跟“以太”这种“没有任何别的物理特性，就是能让光速恒定”的东西类似。", "char_start": 234, "char_end": 284}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这么说吧——只要是个正经的科学家，听到用“以太”这种假说来解释光速恒定现象的宏论都会感到浑身发痒，想冲上台抽人嘴巴子。", "char_start": 285, "char_end": 344}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这是一种最无能的智慧，一种包装成理论的迷信。", "char_start": 345, "char_end": 367}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "如果一个人能毫无介意的接受用这种方法“解释”问题，对ta来说一切知识都将成为多余。", "char_start": 368, "char_end": 409}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你爹为啥跟你关系不好？因为他“脑子有病”。", "char_start": 410, "char_end": 431}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "她为什么跟你分手？因为她“贪慕虚荣”。", "char_start": 432, "char_end": 451}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "所有和你关系不好的都是“脑子有病”，所有不接受你的都是“贪慕虚荣”，所有不响应你的都是“天生奴性”……一切问题都可以用一个专职的妖怪来管。", "char_start": 452, "char_end": 521}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "为啥长包？因为痘痘仙不高兴了。", "char_start": 522, "char_end": 537}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "为啥不下雨？因为水神不高兴了。", "char_start": 538, "char_end": 553}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "为啥不发财？因为财神不高兴了。", "char_start": 554, "char_end": 569}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你看到这种句式的对称性没有？", "char_start": 570, "char_end": 584}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "换句话说，“天生奴性”只是一个当事人临时召唤的新式神，还没来得及起名字就先上岗而已。", "char_start": 585, "char_end": 627}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "用“以太论”解决问题，这不是思考的结果，而是放弃思考的结果。", "char_start": 628, "char_end": 658}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "以太主义要不得，不抛弃以太主义，脑子只是一种豆制品。", "char_start": 659, "char_end": 685}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0327"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎么看待 “刻在骨子里的奴性” 这句话？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“以太主义”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“说这话的人在想象自己是伟大导师，送别人“奴性”帽子只是ta享受这个待遇的必要手续。人家得个丑帽子，ta自己得个大奖章，既打击了敌人，又肥沃了自我，一箭双雕，性价比破表。除了容易挨打，简直没有缺点。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "说这话的人在想象自己是伟大导师，送别人“奴性”帽子只是ta享受这个待遇的必要手续。人家得个丑帽子，ta自己得个大奖章，既打击了敌人，又肥沃了自我，一箭双雕，性价比破表。除了容易挨打，简直没有缺点。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 98, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "97cb678a-3a5e-5167-867a-f31c31a1b52f", "source_ordinal": 1853, "reading_ordinal": 2203, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "武松们", "published_at": "2024-01-04T03:20:09+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/637433290/answer/3348953259"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "一个人做了好事就可以获得私自审判别人的权利吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "哪怕你是李时珍，你没权利做的事情也一样没权利做。这貌似一句废话，但很显然不是人人都懂。", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 67}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "在没有审判资格的前提下，绕过正当程序利用自己的名气公开污损ta人的名誉，这是人所能做的最邪恶的事情之一。因为这不但是公然作恶，还是以恶沽名。", "char_start": 68, "char_end": 138}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这类行为不被视为下流而被鄙弃，反而被吹捧、崇拜，这其实反映出了中国的公民社会意识、法律意识的成熟还任重道远。", "char_start": 139, "char_end": 193}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "小孩子不懂事，以此为“侠肝义胆”“快意恩仇”，家庭教育需要严肃的检讨。这种事小孩子自己不吃大亏、不成为受害人很难自己明白，因为任何能带来义人感、身份感的行径都是幼稚者的渊薮。", "char_start": 194, "char_end": 281}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "ta们很容易支持李逵、武松式的“正义”，却全然不想在真实的故事中，自己不是李逵、武松，而是被李逵们排头砍将去的路人、被武松们一刀一个的丫鬟。", "char_start": 282, "char_end": 352}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "肯定一堆人不服，那我们现在就来个硬碰硬——", "char_start": 353, "char_end": 374}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "我就做过好事，按你的理论，我有权公开审判你，我说你道德败坏，你就是败坏。", "char_start": 375, "char_end": 411}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你不服、你抗议，你就是在用实际行动支持“人即使行过善也不能在不经合法程序的前提下公开审判ta人”，从而证明你完全赞同这个基本的原则。", "char_start": 412, "char_end": 478}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你看——当你是受害人，你立刻就知道该站在哪，不是吗？", "char_start": 479, "char_end": 505}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "那你“不服”什么东西？", "char_start": 506, "char_end": 517}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你赞同，你就是赞同；你反对，就是用行动赞同。", "char_start": 518, "char_end": 540}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "上面这些话，不容你反驳。", "char_start": 541, "char_end": 553}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0327"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何评价贝志城？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“武松们”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“一个人做了好事就可以获得私自审判别人的权利吗？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "一个人做了好事就可以获得私自审判别人的权利吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "45f2482e-15d8-5289-8c1b-c99c079d9f54", "source_ordinal": 1852, "reading_ordinal": 2204, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "猎人", "published_at": "2024-01-04T19:53:51+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/637297593/answer/3349938566"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "“我只以自己的猎获为食，只投资自己创造的机会。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "如果有别做选择，一定不是因为对方给了更好的条件，而是因为我取得了更好的条件。", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 62}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "我的主动寻求，是我决定任何投资的绝对必要条件。", "char_start": 63, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "我没有做其他的寻求，所以没有‘如果’可言。”", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 109}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 5}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0327"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：面试时，如何高情商回答「如果有更好的 offer 摆在你面前，你还会选择我们公司吗」？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004"], "summary": "围绕“猎人”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：““我只以自己的猎获为食，只投资自己创造的机会。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "“我只以自己的猎获为食，只投资自己创造的机会。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "c59edb9f-8c6e-5940-9838-054f2064aee6", "source_ordinal": 1851, "reading_ordinal": 2205, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "屠宰", "published_at": "2024-01-04T20:52:19+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/636869054/answer/3349996000"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "如果你放松一点想象力来考虑，你会发现陆生动物实际上是一根形状比较别扭的管子。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 38}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "以嘴唇和肛周为界，这根管子分为了内外两个面，外面实际上由皮肤角质层将外界与你的身体隔开了。角质层虽然不算是密不透风，但大体上可以看作茧一样性质的事物，稳定性接近头发和角，很难分解，基本等效于一层防腐漆。", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 140}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "问题是这根管子的内壁，为了吸收营养，是由高透过性的富水黏膜来隔开食糜、残渣、消化道菌群和你的身体内部组织的。", "char_start": 141, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "“你”实际上只存在于这内外两壁之间。", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 214}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "问题是，这层富水黏膜构成的内壁是靠不停的调整渗透压和大量的分泌蛋白酶、胃酸等物质来维持有效性的。", "char_start": 215, "char_end": 263}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "一旦你死亡，这些调节机制和分泌机制就趋缓而停止了。于是之前胃肠菌群只消化你吃进去的肉，现在也开始消化你自己长的肉。并且因为不再有排泄和抑制菌群生长的机制存在，这些细菌会大量的吸收营养而增殖，并且产生大量的代谢产物——也就是各种含氮、含硫、含磷小分子。由于这些黏膜是极其富含毛细血管结构的。这些极其细微的末端血管壁厚极薄，稍微破坏就会大面积破裂，导致内部大出血。而这些被释放的血液因为是液态的，对这些细菌来说犹如易消化的牛奶，反应速度更加飞快。", "char_start": 264, "char_end": 485}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这些反应产生的小分子因为是蛋白质崩解的产物，人类为了学会本能回避病死的动物尸体，早就演化出了识别这些小分子的敏感嗅觉，而且和强烈的厌恶反应形成了反射——这也就是所谓的“尸臭感”。", "char_start": 486, "char_end": 575}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "要解决，主要手段就是打破这个进程。", "char_start": 576, "char_end": 593}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "打断的手段就很灵活了，但基本上也就是屠宰行业的核心问题。", "char_start": 594, "char_end": 622}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "首先就是在其他生理活动停止之前尽量先清除血液这一“易燃物”，这一般是指放血和血管灌流。", "char_start": 623, "char_end": 666}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "第二就是在生理活动不再能抵抗消化道菌群之前先解决掉菌群的活性，这一般是指迅速摘除内脏后灌洗。", "char_start": 667, "char_end": 713}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "第三是迅速冷藏、盐腌、醋泡、烟熏、脱水降低菌群活性。", "char_start": 714, "char_end": 740}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 12}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0327"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：猪肉为什么没有尸臭味?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“屠宰”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“如果你放松一点想象力来考虑，你会发现陆生动物实际上是一根形状比较别扭的管子。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "如果你放松一点想象力来考虑，你会发现陆生动物实际上是一根形状比较别扭的管子。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 38, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b9c8edb6-6b54-5b2a-8456-95a5c53d615e", "source_ordinal": 1850, "reading_ordinal": 2206, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "Reason of Beauty", "published_at": "2024-01-05T21:54:39+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/350108687/answer/3351355881"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "为了拥有权力，", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "为了选择的自由，", "char_start": 8, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "为了不必忍受，", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 24}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "为了你不敢想象的生活。", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "取悦？", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "取悦是一种征服，", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 49}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "喜欢是一种投降。", "char_start": 50, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "BEAUTY IS A BEAST, BOY", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 81}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "BEAUTY IS THE POWER, MAN", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 106}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "“FOR WHAT” you ask.", "char_start": 107, "char_end": 126}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "Oh, you poor little thing,", "char_start": 127, "char_end": 153}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "you got no chance.", "char_start": 154, "char_end": 172}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 12}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0327"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：女生去健身房练屁股是为了什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“Reason of Beauty”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“为了拥有权力，”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "为了拥有权力，", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4aaa1d23-42d7-5678-be90-b461b7128852", "source_ordinal": 1849, "reading_ordinal": 2207, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "有争议的合法实践", "published_at": "2024-01-06T10:37:36+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/637571285/answer/3351777372"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "海报做得有点小问题，除此之外挺好的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "好的要害在于——中国需要更多“存在争议的合法实践”来启示民众思考空间可以有多大。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 59}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这是“有争议的合法实践”最珍贵的价值。", "char_start": 60, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "当一条法律被颁布或者修改，由此而来的社会实践空间的改变实际上对老百姓是未知的，甚至等到出现了各种判例，常常也仅对专业的法律圈和当事人有启示意义。", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 152}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "社会大众知道这个新边界，往往要靠这类“有争议但法律的反应却出人意料”来启示。", "char_start": 153, "char_end": 191}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这些东西一方面是大案、要案——比如昆山“龙哥”案；", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 217}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "另一方面就是这类很有争议，但却经过了审批，成功落地、或落地后舆论哗然但法律却并不干预的公共事件（Public Event）。", "char_start": 218, "char_end": 280}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "法律和政策是领导社会的基本工具，而舆论只是仪表盘。当你超低空飞行或者爬升到超越升限，仪表盘会尖叫闪灯是正常的，但并不意味着你应该引入“一切会让仪表盘报警的操作都从底层设计为自动取消”这样的机制。", "char_start": 281, "char_end": 378}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "因为按这个法则来设计的工具将会“安全”“稳定”得像自由落体，所有的轨迹都在所有人的预料之中——包括敌人——最后毫无意外的撞死在设计时没想过的高山上和强风下。", "char_start": 379, "char_end": 457}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "公众自己要习惯一件事——一件有争议而且特别让你自己看不惯的事发生了，尽管你在“特别看不惯”这个问题上受了情绪损失，但在另一面，这也为你自己和你的子孙、家人推开了一扇大门。", "char_start": 458, "char_end": 543}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这个情绪损失往往不如这份刚被启示的自由价值大。", "char_start": 544, "char_end": 567}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "否则在当年法律确立了离婚权时，如果每一个选择离婚的人仍然被汹涌的“破鞋”白眼翻到不得好死，那么法律给了权利又有何实际意义？", "char_start": 568, "char_end": 629}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "自由的边界总要有一些人去趟，这是在为你开辟你自己不愿、不敢、不会去试探的道路，你本身就是受益人。", "char_start": 630, "char_end": 678}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你在批评的时候，也要考虑到你自己的利益损失。", "char_start": 679, "char_end": 701}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0327"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何评价纯女漫展（只允许女性参加的漫展）？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“有争议的合法实践”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“海报做得有点小问题，除此之外挺好的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "海报做得有点小问题，除此之外挺好的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
